{
  "version": 1,
  "partId": "cam15-t2-p1",
  "audioFile": "cam15-test2-part1.mp3",
  "durationSeconds": 486.997333,
  "method": "whisper-local",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Test 2",
      "start": 0.05,
      "end": 2.29
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "This is the IELTS listening test.",
      "start": 2.29,
      "end": 6.17
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You will hear a number of different recordings,",
      "start": 6.17,
      "end": 9.57
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.",
      "start": 9.57,
      "end": 14.09
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions,",
      "start": 14.09,
      "end": 18.17
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and you will have a chance to check your work.",
      "start": 18.17,
      "end": 22.29
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "All the recordings will be played once only.",
      "start": 22.29,
      "end": 26.51
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The test is in four parts.",
      "start": 26.51,
      "end": 30.23
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers to the answer sheet.",
      "start": 30.23,
      "end": 38.59
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now turn to part one.",
      "start": 38.59,
      "end": 45.51
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Part one.",
      "start": 45.51,
      "end": 47.33
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You will hear a woman calling a tourist information office to ask about a festival.",
      "start": 47.33,
      "end": 54.41
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "First, you have some time to look at questions one to four.",
      "start": 54.41,
      "end": 58.53
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now listen carefully and answer questions one to four.",
      "start": 58.53,
      "end": 86.26
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Good morning, you're through to the tourist information office.",
      "start": 86.26,
      "end": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Tim speaking, how can I help you?",
      "start": 90,
      "end": 92.38
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh, hello. Could you give me some information about next month's festival please?",
      "start": 92.38,
      "end": 97.82
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "My family and I will be staying in the town that week.",
      "start": 97.82,
      "end": 101.9
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Of course.",
      "start": 101.9,
      "end": 102.08
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Well, it starts with a concert on the afternoon of the 17th.",
      "start": 102.08,
      "end": 106.84
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh, I heard about that.",
      "start": 106.84,
      "end": 108.54
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The orchestra and singers come from the USA, don't they?",
      "start": 108.54,
      "end": 112.26
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They're from Canada.",
      "start": 112.26,
      "end": 114.08
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They're very popular over there.",
      "start": 114.08,
      "end": 116.78
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They're going to perform a number of well-known pieces that will appeal to children as well as adults.",
      "start": 116.78,
      "end": 122.9
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That sounds good.",
      "start": 122.9,
      "end": 124.2
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "My whole family are interested in music.",
      "start": 124.2,
      "end": 126.92
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The next day, the 18th, there's a performance by a ballet company called Ustartis.",
      "start": 126.92,
      "end": 133.8
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Sorry.",
      "start": 133.8,
      "end": 134.4
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The name is spelled EU-S-T-A-T-I-S.",
      "start": 134.4,
      "end": 142.62
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They appeared in last year's festival and went down very well.",
      "start": 142.62,
      "end": 146.56
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Again, their programme is designed for all ages.",
      "start": 146.56,
      "end": 150.12
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Good. I expect we'll go to that.",
      "start": 150.12,
      "end": 153.18
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I hope there's going to be a play during the festival.",
      "start": 153.18,
      "end": 156.94
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "A comedy, ideally.",
      "start": 156.94,
      "end": 158.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You're in luck.",
      "start": 158.36,
      "end": 159.38
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-37",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "On the 19th and 20th, a local amateur group are performing one written by a member of the group.",
      "start": 159.38,
      "end": 166.68
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-38",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's called Jumima.",
      "start": 166.68,
      "end": 169.06
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-39",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That'll be on in the town hall.",
      "start": 169.06,
      "end": 171.66
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-40",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They've already performed it two or three times.",
      "start": 171.66,
      "end": 174.38
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-41",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I haven't seen it myself, but the review in the local paper was very good.",
      "start": 174.38,
      "end": 179.46
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-42",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And is it suitable for children?",
      "start": 179.46,
      "end": 182.16
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-43",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes. In fact, it's aimed more at children than adults.",
      "start": 182.16,
      "end": 186.26
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-44",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So both performances are in the afternoon.",
      "start": 186.26,
      "end": 190.02
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-45",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And what about dance?",
      "start": 190.02,
      "end": 192.48
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-46",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Will there be any performances?",
      "start": 192.48,
      "end": 194.52
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-47",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, also on the 20th, but in the evening.",
      "start": 194.52,
      "end": 198.18
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-48",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "A professional company is putting on a show of modern pieces with electronic music by young composers.",
      "start": 198.18,
      "end": 205.4
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-49",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Uh-huh.",
      "start": 205.4,
      "end": 206.18
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-50",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The show is about how people communicate or fail to communicate with each other.",
      "start": 206.18,
      "end": 211.64
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-51",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So it's got the rather strange name, chat.",
      "start": 211.64,
      "end": 214.76
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-52",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I suppose that's because that's something we do both face-to-face and online.",
      "start": 214.76,
      "end": 221.24
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-53",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's right.",
      "start": 221.24,
      "end": 225.46
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-54",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions five to ten.",
      "start": 225.46,
      "end": 261.87
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-55",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now listen and answer questions five to ten.",
      "start": 261.87,
      "end": 268.65
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-56",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now there are also some workshops and other activities.",
      "start": 268.65,
      "end": 272.23
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-57",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They'll all take place at least once every day.",
      "start": 272.23,
      "end": 275.71
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-58",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So everyone who wants to take part will have a chance.",
      "start": 275.71,
      "end": 279.45
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-59",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Good. We're particularly interested in cookery.",
      "start": 279.45,
      "end": 282.85
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-60",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You don't happen to have a cookery workshop, do you?",
      "start": 282.85,
      "end": 286.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-61",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "We certainly do.",
      "start": 286.25,
      "end": 287.63
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-62",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's going to focus on how to make food part of a healthy lifestyle.",
      "start": 287.63,
      "end": 292.57
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-63",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And it'll show that even sweet things like cakes can contain much less sugar than they usually do.",
      "start": 292.57,
      "end": 300.27
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-64",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That might be worth going to.",
      "start": 300.27,
      "end": 302.53
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-65",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "We're trying to encourage our children to cook.",
      "start": 302.53,
      "end": 305.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-66",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Another workshop is just for children and that's on creating posters to reflect the history of the town.",
      "start": 305.25,
      "end": 313.69
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-67",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The aim is to make children aware of how both the town and people's lives have changed over the centuries.",
      "start": 313.69,
      "end": 322.21
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-68",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The results will be exhibited in the community centre.",
      "start": 322.21,
      "end": 325.77
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-69",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Then the other workshop is in toy making and that's for adults only.",
      "start": 325.77,
      "end": 331.35
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-70",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh, why is that?",
      "start": 331.35,
      "end": 333.83
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-71",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Because it involves carpentry.",
      "start": 333.83,
      "end": 336.05
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-72",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Participants will be making toys out of wood.",
      "start": 336.05,
      "end": 339.65
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-73",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So there'll be a lot of sharp chisels and other tools around.",
      "start": 339.65,
      "end": 344.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-74",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It makes sense to keep children away from it.",
      "start": 344.25,
      "end": 347.31
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-75",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start": 347.31,
      "end": 348.29
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-76",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now let me tell you about some of the outdoor activities.",
      "start": 348.29,
      "end": 352.83
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-77",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They'll be supervised while swimming.",
      "start": 352.83,
      "end": 355.49
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-78",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Wild swimming? What's that?",
      "start": 355.49,
      "end": 357.91
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-79",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It just means swimming in natural waters rather than a swimming pool.",
      "start": 357.91,
      "end": 363.49
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-80",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh, okay. In a lake, for instance.",
      "start": 363.49,
      "end": 366.47
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-81",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, there's a beautiful one just outside the town and that'll be the venue for the swimming.",
      "start": 366.47,
      "end": 372.79
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-82",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There'll be lifeguards on duty, so it's suitable for all ages.",
      "start": 372.79,
      "end": 377.65
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-83",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And finally, there'll be a walk in some nearby woods every day.",
      "start": 377.65,
      "end": 383.15
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-84",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The leader is an expert on insects.",
      "start": 383.15,
      "end": 386.57
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-85",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "He'll show some that live in the woods and how important they are for the environment.",
      "start": 386.57,
      "end": 392.01
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-86",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So there are going to be all sorts of different things to do during the festival.",
      "start": 392.01,
      "end": 397.13
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-87",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There certainly are.",
      "start": 397.13,
      "end": 398.67
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-88",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "If you'd like to read about how the preparations for the festival are going,",
      "start": 398.67,
      "end": 403.43
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-89",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "the festival organiser is keeping a blog.",
      "start": 403.43,
      "end": 405.75
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-90",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Just search online for the festival website and you'll find it.",
      "start": 405.75,
      "end": 410.67
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-91",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Well, thank you very much for all the information.",
      "start": 410.67,
      "end": 413.81
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-92",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You're welcome. Goodbye.",
      "start": 413.81,
      "end": 415.83
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-93",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "start": 415.83,
      "end": 419.12
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-94",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That is the end of part one.",
      "start": 419.12,
      "end": 422.54
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-95",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You now have one minute to check your answers to part one.",
      "start": 422.54,
      "end": 486.997
    }
  ]
}
